    "rationale": "Thermofeel implements Di Napoli methodology with ECMWF operational refinements. ECMWF maintains thermofeel as the reference implementation. The differences from Di Napoli are methodologically justified (instantaneous vs interval-averaged dsrp). The differences from ERA5-HEAT reflect expected methodology/reference-product distinctions.",
